 917:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * @param ipaddr The IP address to be resolved.
 918:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * @param q If non-NULL, a pbuf that must be delivered to the IP address.
 919:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * q is not freed by this function.
 920:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  *
 921:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * @note q must only be ONE packet, not a packet queue!
 922:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  *
 923:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * @return
 924:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * - ERR_BUF Could not make room for Ethernet header.
 925:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * - ERR_MEM Hardware address unknown, and no more ARP entries available
 926:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  *   to query for address or queue the packet.
 927:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * - ERR_MEM Could not queue packet due to memory shortage.
 928:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * - ERR_RTE No route to destination (no gateway to external networks).
 929:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  * - ERR_ARG Non-unicast address given, those will not appear in ARP cache.
 930:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/etharp.c ****  *
